{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":14,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܡܝܼܪܹܗ ܣܲܟ݂ܠܵܐ ܒܠܸܒܹܗ: ”ܠܲܝܬ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ.“","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܪܝܼܒܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ، ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܛܲܢ̈ܦܹܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܲܝܬ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܛܵܒ݂ܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܫܡܲܝܵܐ ܓܘܼܫܸܩ ܠܹܗ ܥܲܠܔ ܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܸܚܙܵܝܵܐ ܐܸܢ ܐܝܼܬ ܦܲܪܡܝܼܵܢܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܵܥܝܵܢܵܐ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܩܠܝܼܒ ܠܗܘܿܢ، ܡܸܚܕܵܕܹ̈ܐ ܗܘܹܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܛܲܡܐܹ̈ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܲܝܬ ܥܵܒ݂ܕܵܢܵܐ ܕܛܵܒ݂ܬܵ‌ܐ، ܠܲܝܬ ܐܘܼܦ ܚܲܕ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܵܐ، ܠܵܐ ܝܕܝܼܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܟܠܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܦܵܠܚܵܢܹ̈ܐ ܕܥܵܘܠܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܟܹܐ ܐܵܟ݂ܠܝܼ ܠܥܲܡܝܼ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܕܐܵܟ݂ܠܝܼ ܠܲܚܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܠܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܹܐ ܩܵܪܝܼ؟","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܬܵܡܵܐ ܙܕܝܼܥ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܙܕܘܼܥܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܥܲܡ ܬܵܘܠܲܕܬܵ‌ܐ ܙܲܕܝܼܩܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܸܠܟܵܐ ܕܡܸܣܟܹܢܵܐ ܟܹܐ ܡܲܣܠܹܝܬܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܹܗ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܛܘܼܒ݂ܵܐ ܕܐܵܬܹ‌ܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܨܸܗܝܘܿܢ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܵܐ ܕܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ؛","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܕܡܲܕܸܪ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ ܠܥܲܡܹܗ ܡ̣ܢ ܓܵܠܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܸܬ ܦܵܨܹܚ ܝܲܥܩܘܿܒ݂، ܒܸܬ ܚܵܕܹܐ ܐܝܼܣܪܵܐܹܝܠܔ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":7}